      <p begin="01:28.260" end="01:29.760" ttm:agent="v1">Hey, what's up, though?</p>
      <p begin="01:28.940" end="01:31.210" ttm:agent="v1">I hate a bitch that's hatin' on a bitch and they both hoes</p>
      <p begin="01:31.210" end="01:33.370" ttm:agent="v1">I hate a nigga hatin' on them niggas and they both broke</p>
      <p begin="01:33.370" end="01:36.210" ttm:agent="v1">If you ain't coming for no chili, what you come for?</p>
      <p begin="01:36.210" end="01:38.820" ttm:agent="v1">Nigga feel like he entitled 'cause he knew me since a kid</p>
      <p begin="01:38.820" end="01:40.940" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I cut my granny off if she don't see it how I see it, hm</p>
      <p begin="01:40.940" end="01:43.640" ttm:agent="v1">Got a big mouth but he lack big ideas</p>
      <p begin="01:43.640" end="01:45.910" ttm:agent="v1">Send him to the moon, that's just how I feel, yelling</p>
